        "Content": "**RAY COOKE LETTINGS - PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST- VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST** \r\n\r\n*** BEAUTIFUL 2 BEDROOM APARTMENT ****** REFURBISHED THROUGHOUT ******** FIRST TIME LETTING ****** CAN COME FURNISHED OR UNFURNISHED ******* SUPER LOCATION ******* AVAILABLE NOW!! \r\n\r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this fantastic two-bedroom apartment to the market in Millrace Court, Saggart, Co Dublin. This stunning property is situated in a prime location within walking distance of Rathcoole and Saggart Villages with their array of amenities. Avoca, local primary and secondary schools, The Luas and Rathcoole Park with its beautiful scenery and walking trails are but a few of the many attractions to this excellent location. The bright and spacious accommodation briefly comprises of entrance hallway, two double bedrooms, open plan living/kitchen/dining area, storage room and main family bathroom. This Apartment is presented in turn key condition throughout having been freshly painted. It boasts gas fired central heating, double glazed windows, fully alarmed, top quality flooring and ample parking to the front. \r\n\r\nExtra Features: Beautiful 2 bed / 1 bath Apartment 2 x Spacious Double bedrooms Located on the ground floor fantastic condition throughout Gas fired central heating Double glazed windows Fully fitted modern kitchen 2 spacious bedrooms with Built in wardrobes Ample storage space Ample communal parking to the front of the property Secure development Bus routes on your doorstep Within easy reach of Rathcoole and Saggart Village Within easy reach of The M50 Motorway & The Luas Available Now!"
